"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#範例bundlecomposition-與-bundlemessage","content":"範例：Bundle.composition 與 Bundle.message","locale":"zh-TW"},"293":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-1","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#直接-identity-搜尋","content":"直接 identity 搜尋","locale":"zh-TW"},"294":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-2","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#chained-search","content":"Chained search","locale":"zh-TW"},"295":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-3","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-TW"},"296":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-4","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","content":"與搜尋參數相關的程式碼位於`models\\FHIR\\queryBuild.js` 以及 `models\\FHIR\\searchParameterQueryHandler.js` 檔案。","locale":"zh-TW"},"297":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-5","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","content":"`queryBuild.js`: 根據不同的 Data Type 組成單個MongoDB 查詢語法。","locale":"zh-TW"},"298":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-6","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","content":"`searchParameterQueryHandler.js`: 根據 HTTP 網址中的查詢條件使用 `queryBuild.js` 取得完整的 MongoDB 查詢語法。","locale":"zh-TW"},"299":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-7","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","content":"由產生器產生之部分搜尋參數可能是錯誤的或遺失。您可以使用 `models\\FHIR\\searchParameterQueryHandler.js` 內的方法修正。","locale":"zh-TW"},"300":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-8","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#範例bundlecomposition-與-bundlemessage","content":"FHIR R4 將 `Bundle.composition` 與 `Bundle.message` 定義為 reference 搜尋參數。Burni 透過 SearchParameter Registry 解析這兩個參數，且只評估 `entry[0].resource`：","locale":"zh-TW"},"301":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-9","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#範例bundlecomposition-與-bundlemessage","content":"`composition` — `type` 為 `document`、第一個 entry 為 `Composition` 的 Bundle","locale":"zh-TW"},"302":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-10","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#範例bundlecomposition-與-bundlemessage","content":"`message` — `type` 為 `message`、第一個 entry 為 `MessageHeader` 的 Bundle","locale":"zh-TW"},"303":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-11","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#範例bundlecomposition-與-bundlemessage","content":"Burni 不會對整個 `entry` 陣列做 fan-out，只有第一個 embedded resource 會參與這類特殊搜尋。","locale":"zh-TW"},"304":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-12","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#直接-identity-搜尋","content":"支援的值形式包含 relative `ResourceType/id`、依固定 target type 正規化的 bare id，以及可與 `entry[0].fullUrl` 比對的 absolute URL。versioned、contained 與 logical identifier reference 會被拒絕。","locale":"zh-TW"},"305":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-13","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#直接-identity-搜尋","content":"範例 URL：","locale":"zh-TW"},"306":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-14","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#chained-search","content":"inline hop 之後，Burni 會套用 Registry 中 target resource 的 SearchParameter plan。範例：","locale":"zh-TW"},"307":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-15","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#chained-search","content":"`composition.patient` 遵循 `Composition::patient`，可 fan-out 到 `Patient` 與 `Group`。`MessageHeader.focus` 是 open reference target，因此繼續 chain 前必須提供 type filter：","locale":"zh-TW"},"308":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-16","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#chained-search","content":"此請求會以 HTTP 400 與 `missing-type-filter` 被拒絕。","locale":"zh-TW"},"309":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-17","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#限制","content":"只評估 `entry[0].resource`；即使後續 entry 含有符合條件的 Composition 或 MessageHeader，也不會影響結果。","locale":"zh-TW"},"310":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-18","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#限制","content":"Bundle type 與第一個 entry 的 resource type 必須相符；不符合 FHIR 約束的 stored Bundle 只是不命中，不會回傳參數錯誤。","locale":"zh-TW"},"311":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","type":"page","content":"概觀","breadcrumbs":["Docs","v2 (LTS)","搜尋參數"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","locale":"zh-TW"},"312":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-0","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#搜尋參數概觀","content":"搜尋參數概觀","locale":"zh-TW"},"313":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-1","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#search-parameter-types","content":"Search Parameter Types","locale":"zh-TW"},"314":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-2","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#parameters-for-all-resources","content":"Parameters for all resources","locale":"zh-TW"},"315":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-3","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#search-result-parameters","content":"Search result parameters","locale":"zh-TW"},"316":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-4","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#derived-index-與自訂-searchparameter","content":"Derived index 與自訂 SearchParameter","locale":"zh-TW"},"317":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-5","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#非-temporal-derived-index-邊界","content":"非 temporal derived index 邊界","locale":"zh-TW"},"318":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-6","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#搜尋參數概觀","content":"Burni 目前支援的 FHIR search operations 如下:","locale":"zh-TW"},"319":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-7","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#search-parameter-types","content":"Number","locale":"zh-TW"},"320":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-8","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#search-parameter-types","content":"Date/DateTime","locale":"zh-TW"},"321":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-9","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#search-parameter-types","content":"String","locale":"zh-TW"},"322":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-10","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#search-parameter-types","content":"Token","locale":"zh-TW"},"323":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-11","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#search-parameter-types","content":"Reference","locale":"zh-TW"},"324":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-12","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#parameters-for-all-resources","content":"\\_id","locale":"zh-TW"},"325":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-13","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#parameters-for-all-resources","content":"\\_lastUpdated","locale":"zh-TW"},"326":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-14","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#search-result-parameters","content":"\\_count","locale":"zh-TW"},"327":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-15","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#derived-index-與自訂-searchparameter","content":"Burni 的 SearchParameter Registry 負責查詢正確性；MongoDB derived index 只負責查詢效能。兩者是分開的生命週期。","locale":"zh-TW"},"328":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-16","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#derived-index-與自訂-searchparameter","content":"第一階段 provisioning 會為 **built-in artifact 中 approved 的 temporal 與非 temporal SearchParameter** 建立 derived index。這些 lookup 必須同時滿足 active、可編譯、通過對應 index policy，且 extraction/projection 具備安全的 index contract。","locale":"zh-TW"},"329":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-17","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#非-temporal-derived-index-邊界","content":"**token**：支援 Coding/CodeableConcept 的 system-code correlation，以及 Identifier/ContactPoint 的 system-value correlation；`:text` 查詢不建立 derived index。","locale":"zh-TW"},"330":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-18","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#非-temporal-derived-index-邊界","content":"**reference**：只索引 stored `reference` field；`Reference.type` target guard 仍由 runtime filter 負責。","locale":"zh-TW"},"331":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-19","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#非-temporal-derived-index-邊界","content":"**string**：只為 exact projected leaf 建立 equality index；default prefix 與 `:contains` 維持 regex 語意，不宣稱 B-tree index。","locale":"zh-TW"},"332":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-20","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#非-temporal-derived-index-邊界","content":"**number / quantity**：使用現有 numeric BSON field；`sa`、`eb`、`ap` comparator 尚未支援，不進 capability matrix。","locale":"zh-TW"},"333":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-21","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#非-temporal-derived-index-邊界","content":"**uri**：使用 raw URI single-field index；`:above` / `:below` 共用同一 raw key identity。","locale":"zh-TW"},"334":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-22","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#非-temporal-derived-index-邊界","content":"**array correlation**：只接受可證明的單一 array scope；parallel multikey、positional path 與 unsafe branch 會產生 rejection diagnostic。","locale":"zh-TW"},"335":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-23","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#非-temporal-derived-index-邊界","content":"**Database 自訂 SearchParameter** 預設仍可正常執行查詢，但**不會**進入 desired index manifest，因此不建立 derived index。這不代表查詢被禁止，只代表可能使用 COLLSCAN。若缺少 performance index，請以 `npm run mongodb:verify` 檢查 drift，並在部署流程執行 `npm run mongodb:provision`。","locale":"zh-TW"},"336":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-24","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#非-temporal-derived-index-邊界","content":"期望的 derived index 狀態合併在執行時產生的 desired index manifest；詳細部署步驟見 部署 的 MongoDB provisioning 章節。","locale":"zh-TW"},"337":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-25","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#非-temporal-derived-index-邊界","content":"下一章您將會知道如何修正 Burni 遺失或錯誤的搜尋參數。下一章自行新增搜尋參數","locale":"zh-TW"},"338":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration","type":"page","content":"設定","breadcrumbs":["Docs","v2 (LTS)","讓我們開始吧！"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration","locale":"zh-TW"},"339":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration-0","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration#configuration","content":"Configuration","locale":"zh-TW"},"340":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration-1","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration#configconfigjs","content":"config\\config.js","locale":"zh-TW"},"341":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration-2","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration#dotenv","content":"dotenv","locale":"zh-TW"},"342":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration-3","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration#產生程式碼","content":"產生程式碼","locale":"zh-TW"},"343":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration-4","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration#configconfigjs","content":"此檔案在設定您所想支援的FHIR Resources(資源)。","locale":"zh-TW"},"344":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration-5","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration#configconfigjs","content":"如果您想支援所有的FHIR Resources(資源)，您可以執行以下指令：","locale":"zh-TW"},"345":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration-6","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration#configconfigjs","content":"執行指令將會產生已設定所有FHIR Resource(資源)的config.js檔案","locale":"zh-TW"},"346":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration-7","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration#dotenv","content":"`.env` 於專案根目錄","locale":"zh-TW"},"347":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration-8","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration#產生程式碼","content":"如果您已完成以上的設定，您必須執行以下指令產生 Mongoose Model、API 程式碼讓 Burni 正常運作。","locale":"zh-TW"},"348":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration-9","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/configuration#產生程式碼","content":"`TypeError: genParamFunc[type] is not a function` 代表此類型的搜尋參數目前不支援。","locale":"zh-TW"},"349":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","type":"page","content":"部屬","breadcrumbs":["Docs","v2 (LTS)","讓我們開始吧！"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","locale":"zh-TW"},"350":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-0","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#使用-nodejs","content":"使用 Node.JS","locale":"zh-TW"},"351":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-1","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#使用-docker-compose","content":"使用 docker-compose","locale":"zh-TW"},"352":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-2","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#docker-compose部屬","content":"docker-compose部屬","locale":"zh-TW"},"353":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-3","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#mongodb-schema-與-index-provisioning","content":"MongoDB schema 與 index provisioning","locale":"zh-TW"},"354":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-4","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#部署前-provisioning建議","content":"部署前 provisioning（建議）","locale":"zh-TW"},"355":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-5","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#只讀-verify","content":"只讀 verify","locale":"zh-TW"},"356":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-6","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#id-duplicate-audit只讀","content":"`id` duplicate audit（只讀）","locale":"zh-TW"},"357":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-7","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#startup-opt-in","content":"Startup opt-in","locale":"zh-TW"},"358":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-8","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#與-searchparameter-derived-index-的關係","content":"與 SearchParameter derived index 的關係","locale":"zh-TW"},"359":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-9","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#使用-nodejs","content":"您會看到 console 打印以下訊息：","locale":"zh-TW"},"360":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-10","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#使用-docker-compose","content":"以下是來自根目錄 `docker-compose.yaml` 的範例","locale":"zh-TW"},"361":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-11","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#mongodb-schema-與-index-provisioning","content":"Burni 預設將 Mongoose `autoCreate` 與 `autoIndex` 設為 `false`。Model registration 只代表 application process 內已註冊 model，**不保證** MongoDB collection 或 index 已存在。正式部署應在 application 啟動前執行 provisioning，或明確啟用 startup opt-in。","locale":"zh-TW"},"362":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-12","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#mongodb-schema-與-index-provisioning","content":"期望的 collection 與 index manifest 會在執行時依已註冊 model、model catalog、approved built-in temporal 定義，以及通過 policy 的非 temporal SearchParameter derived index 以 deterministic 方式產生。Manifest 會保存 `artifactIdentity`（compiled SearchParameter artifact）與 `derivedIndexPolicy.searchParameterPolicyVersion`（non-temporal index policy）。Provisioning 會依該 manifest 與 MongoDB 實際狀態 reconcile，並將結果寫入 `MongoProvisioningState`；多 instance 執行時由 `MongoProvisioningLock` 以 database-scoped lease 互斥。需要 JSON 副本時可用 `writeDesiredManifestArtifact()` 寫出（預設路徑 `models/mongodb/provisioning/artifacts/desired-index-manifest.json`）。","locale":"zh-TW"},"363":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-13","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#部署前-provisioning建議","content":"設定與 application 相同的 MongoDB 連線環境變數（`MONGODB_CONNECTION_URL`，或 `MONGODB_HOSTS` / `MONGODB_PORTS` / `MONGODB_NAME`），然後執行：","locale":"zh-TW"},"364":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-14","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#部署前-provisioning建議","content":"此 command 依序完成 control-plane 初始化、取得 lock、建立 collections、建立 baseline indexes、建立 approved built-in derived indexes（temporal 與非 temporal SearchParameter）、執行 verify，並保存 manifest checksum 與 drift 摘要。成功時 exit code 為 `0`；任一 phase 失敗時回傳非零狀態。","locale":"zh-TW"},"365":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-15","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#部署前-provisioning建議","content":"**部分完成與重試**：Provisioning 採 additive-only policy，不 rollback 已建立的 collection 或 index。若 run 在中途失敗，已完成的 DDL 會保留；再次執行 `mongodb:provision` 會從 desired/actual diff 繼續補齊缺少項目。Lock lease 到期後可由其他 process 回收 expired lock 並重試。","locale":"zh-TW"},"366":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-16","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#只讀-verify","content":"`mongodb:verify` **不執行任何 DDL**，也不修改資料。它只讀取 actual collections 與 indexes，回報：","locale":"zh-TW"},"367":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-17","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#只讀-verify","content":"**missing**：期望存在但資料庫缺少的 index","locale":"zh-TW"},"368":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-18","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#只讀-verify","content":"**extra**：資料庫存在但 manifest 未宣告的 index（只報告，不刪除）","locale":"zh-TW"},"369":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-19","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#只讀-verify","content":"**mismatch**：key 或 options 與期望不一致的 index","locale":"zh-TW"},"370":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-20","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#只讀-verify","content":"**manifest identity drift**：目前 desired manifest 的 checksum 或 version 與 `MongoProvisioningState` 中最近一次成功 run 保存的值不一致","locale":"zh-TW"},"371":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-21","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#只讀-verify","content":"verify 失敗時 exit code 為 `2`。","locale":"zh-TW"},"372":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-22","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#id-duplicate-audit只讀","content":"掃描 resource 與 history collections 中的 duplicate `id`，供未來 unique migration 前的 clean-audit gate 使用。**不修改任何資料**。一般 provisioning **不會**自動將既有 `id` index 改為 unique。","locale":"zh-TW"},"373":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-23","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#startup-opt-in","content":"預設 `node server.js` **不會**執行 provisioning；application readiness（`mongodb.ready`）與 provisioning readiness 是分開的狀態。缺少 performance index（包含 non-temporal derived index）不會阻止 HTTP listen，但可能導致 COLLSCAN；`mongodb:verify` diagnostics 會標示 missing performance index。","locale":"zh-TW"},"374":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-24","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#startup-opt-in","content":"若要在 application ready 前等待完整 provisioning run，設定：","locale":"zh-TW"},"375":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-25","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#startup-opt-in","content":"或 `MONGODB_PROVISION_ON_STARTUP=1`。啟用後，server bootstrap 會在 listen 前執行與 `mongodb:provision` 相同的 locked run；失敗時不宣告 ready、不 listen，並以非零狀態結束 process。正式環境仍建議使用獨立 deployment command，而非 startup opt-in。","locale":"zh-TW"},"376":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-26","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#與-searchparameter-derived-index-的關係","content":"Derived index manifest 合併 temporal 與通過 policy 的非 temporal（token、reference、string、number、quantity、uri）built-in lookup。Database 自訂 SearchParameter 仍可執行查詢，但預設不建立 derived index。Derived index reconcile 為 additive-only：missing 可由 `provision` 建立，extra 或 mismatch 只由 `verify` 報告，不自動刪除；query runtime 不使用 `$hint`。Rollback 時可停止新 policy 或回復 manifest 版本，已建立的 index 不會被自動刪除。詳見 搜尋參數概觀 與 ADR 0010。","locale":"zh-TW"},"377":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","type":"page","content":"安裝","breadcrumbs":["Docs","v2 (LTS)","讓我們開始吧！"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","locale":"zh-TW"},"378":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation-0","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation#installation","content":"Installation","locale":"zh-TW"},"379":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation-1","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation#使用-git","content":"使用 git","locale":"zh-TW"},"380":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation-2","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation#installation","content":"請確認您的環境有以下內容：","locale":"zh-TW"},"381":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation-3","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation#installation","content":"git","locale":"zh-TW"},"382":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation-4","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation#installation","content":"Node.JS >= 22","locale":"zh-TW"},"38